# A copy of a spell copies the decisions made for it, additional costs included (CR 707.10): a copy of Close Encounter deals
# damage equal to the power of the object the original chose. Bot1 chooses its Memnite (1/1) and targets its own Ornithopter
# (0/2), then copies Close Encounter with Choreographed Sparks, keeping the target. The copy deals 1 and Close Encounter 1:
# the Ornithopter dies.

